<title>ITALY: ITALIAN CRUDE IMPORTS ROSE 1.4 PCT JAN-MAY.</title>
<headline>ITALIAN CRUDE IMPORTS ROSE 1.4 PCT JAN-MAY.</headline>
<dateline>ROME 1997-08-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>Italian crude oil imports totalled some 30.6 million tonnes in the first five months of 1997, up 1.4 percent from the year earlier period, trade body Unione Petrolifera (UP) data showed.</p>
<p>Libya accounted for 32.2 percent of the imports, Saudi Arabia 17.1 percent, Iran 15.5 percent and the former Soviet Union 10.3 percent.</p>
<p>-- Milan newsroom +392 66129589</p>
